  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Decorations/Expansion?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Expansion decorations</b></span></h3>\n<p><b>Expansion decorations</b> come as rewards for unlocking special <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-23339\" title=\"Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion</a> sections of the farm. When players have unlocked a section they get the decoration located on this section. These decorations can then be moved or stored like any other decoration.\n</p><p>Expansion decorations are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 22.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABalloon_Bench.png\" title=\"Balloon Bench.png (411 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d4/Balloon_Bench.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20181211065504\" title=\"Balloon Bench.png (411 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Balloon Bench\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Balloon Bench.png (411 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Balloon Bench\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Balloon Bench</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ABanquette.png\" title=\"Banquette.png (418 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d6/Banquette.png/revis